{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/ManualIntegration"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Download the SDK","anchor":"Download-the-SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework","│   ├── CardSessions.xcframework","│   ├── Card.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"text"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks","anchor":"Required-Frameworks"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Network Token Provisioning (Sessions Approach)","anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Sessions-Approach"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following framework is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"required","type":"text"}]},{"text":" for the sessions-based provisioning:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Framework"}]}],[{"typ